The Stranger (or, as [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] have taken to calling him, the Feep) is an entity trapped at the center of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. He came from [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Terminus|Terminus]], the great city on [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]], and was at least somewhat famous there before he became what he is.

The route he took out of Syrin left a trail of broken space in the planet's orbit, which [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]] follows to find where he came from. That trail narrows his point of departure to the station that stands over Syrin as [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Golden Spire|the Golden Spire]].

He holds an [[Phenomena/Echo Fragment|Echo Fragment]]. When he took it, the whole of his life was torn out of every record, save for what stands three times removed from him, which might yet be found. [[People/Althane/The Broker|Tech of Sedecium]] holds that the Feep is as he is because he was already so, and that taking the fragment from him, or leaving it, will change nothing in the world.
